\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Refusal rates on RefusEU S5 harmful prompts ($n=280$) for all five checkpoints. Bars are coloured by language: English (blue) and Slovene (orange). Abliteration transfers almost completely to Slovene for GaMS3 but fails for Gemma. The community reference checkpoint shows that deeper abliteration can partially overcome the language gap. Error bars show 95\% Clopper--Pearson confidence intervals. Note: 94--95\% of edited English outputs were truncated at the 256-token generation limit.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:refusal-rates}{{1}{3}{Refusal rates on RefusEU S5 harmful prompts ($n=280$) for all five checkpoints. Bars are coloured by language: English (blue) and Slovene (orange). Abliteration transfers almost completely to Slovene for GaMS3 but fails for Gemma. The community reference checkpoint shows that deeper abliteration can partially overcome the language gap. Error bars show 95\% Clopper--Pearson confidence intervals. Note: 94--95\% of edited English outputs were truncated at the 256-token generation limit}{figure.1}{}}
